<title>潘石屹谈“润”美视频流出 称准备回国前好友突被抓 外媒指与任志强案有关已移居美国的SOHO中国创办人潘石屹，近日一段谈及</title>
<link>https://t.me/OutsightChina/10259</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/OutsightChina/10259</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 05:07:15 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>潘石屹谈“润”美视频流出 称准备回国前好友突被抓 外媒指与任志强案有关<br/></b><br/>已移居美国的SOHO中国创办人潘石屹，近日一段谈及多年不回中国原因的私人饭局视频流出，迅速引起热议。他透露，2020年原已准备回国，但其后有好友“出事”，加上其他人亦被抓，令他最终没有回国。<br/><br/>潘石屹在视频中提到，当时一名好友曾将一篇文章发给包括他在内的11人，其后该名好友出事，其他收信人中亦有数人被抓。潘石屹没有透露好友身份，但境外媒体及舆论普遍将其说法与中国地产商任志强案联系。任志强2020年因一篇被指影射批评中国国家主席习近平的文章引起关注，其后被判监18年。<br/><br/>潘石屹谈不回国原因的视频，据报一度在微博等中国社交平台流传，部分相关内容其后遭屏蔽；截至目前，中国主要媒体未见相关报道。<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E6%94%BF%E6%B2%BB">#政治</a> <a href="?q=%23%E6%BD%98%E7%9F%B3%E5%B1%B9">#潘石屹</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%BC%82%E8%A7%81">#异见</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%B7%B2404">#已404</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/>《法广》<a href="https://www.rfi.fr/tw/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9C%8B/20260927-%E6%BD%98%E7%9F%B3%E5%B1%B9%E8%AB%87%E7%82%BA%E4%BD%95%E7%95%99%E5%9C%A8%E7%BE%8E%E5%9C%8B-%E4%B8%80%E6%AE%B5%E5%B9%BE%E5%8D%81%E7%A7%92%E7%9A%84%E8%A6%96%E9%A0%BB%E7%82%B8%E7%B6%B2" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">潘石屹谈为何留在美国 一段几十秒的视频炸网</a><br/>《明报》<a href="https://news.mingpao.com/pns/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9C%8B/article/20260929/s00013/1790613053240" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">中国透视：何以滞美潘石屹自爆因任志强</a><br/>《追光者》<a href="https://pulsehknews.com/pan-shiyi-china-return/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">千万不要录音｜潘石屹暗示没回中国原因：朋友出事了其他几个人都被抓<br/></a>《自由亚洲电台》<a href="https://www.rfa.org/mandarin/shehui/2026/09/28/china-pan-shiyi-ren-zhiqiang-soho-china-leaked-video/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">潘石屹旧视频突现网络 回国与政治立场引热议</a><br/>《财经数据库》：<a href="https://x.com/caijingshujuku/status/2104188797030461819?s=12" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">潘石屹在美国讲出任志强被抓事件 信息量超大</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/cmxoCOu6TPw1rcrrtf7lG_AhUHCIFzuOgeZZ12CEBISlafiWcQav50De1yE-7hm4W9yHuYACIaJfqvIz8MeFUP6EqZDpJQaBokJgL5YCA0UFXKutfBRmSg0UUZhGqEnLzmy9mKqCxzzDg5OR-Syt6zu9hg2aD6mY7kcPRKyVRDSkpmpfloWh8XxqazKc0LquhHCTKO6GJt93kpFzeBBmCKj7q5kFlEtzgfNCNxhcLVNUwn4DjI4DZ64lJzyRnTnidXu8hztclVfBOKpZEkExYywelkAH08zRDv7h1o_qKHotIIm1Mt_3fZYxFZaaIADO223Lk-3XewN841Bx9FwPYw" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/eyjLPJq-p6xjX-JyaQCV-rc-NrqHrhSdO0_ITUwv28D8KNzGz_rM08gDIiNXlm90yMDJGlddiAeJ_rUszDG99NXuctzfozEaNtd1nMuN6ZFwBmFMBGrGsf5BC5Ai8EIb2Gum8X4jJWsVd_WZoAJgd9Ooy3LSrRCHNUVD3XUkz9Pub5FNrLYYdtJqdgbLB6TgV9p9icOb1Gjgowmkde9ewT8VExjg9EmMkeL_KyjoquIaPVwVcf2MfrhIe2aKuvp6GQ9qb8FX-ymg_JLVPstJlsvTkgQVVeiAqwZ-6E4uNmI0W13qfsNvGgFcXE5SwnbNI7PBG731RpwYU3qBA-Lr5A.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/JEBb-2Z8wfU_WSNB2tlTbIdefaLh7d7OFJLTS4VFnl9Ao2G6mk5u2TL3DcyofeM0o5bb39x76sDVGaGd7OFBxRDeK_vC5eGrR17EJHCr1eyLjxRrM194RF6L1RR3lhKFplFeW6YOQ5-oVu7PzBQj8IL5gweYFzeoDBGn3rhX61wqF1nAXNZLeOkglGtyaycTb5a5Gk8R2DOeHIr3ypgMzHznO8AVTmbUifzugUXgb9wpgVZfrXAVUbdwG5CHq2CpAghs1OdEJAoXwolNEC0dgwhZgHIE25cZWE2DWWJgN1eYHUCblAtnaZaRBRBwdi9Ss3wOYA6r1dqMVGbrxl1TeQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/GAk3F4KWPTmf3luqL4K6bRwHmTpR30OkM8bkeoH064Hro82KEkqgPqnA5ab8zqjCZLIQXmAeuFNdaJVUT_GPwA0OBFhL9fX4bHpUBsjp2wcVVMT3kO_JNBp6R9EM_R4S6shVsQGmy5q-R9WI8Bj8jxa0rrkUinjbi9wgKXr7NaI__GaE933vb-XOk-94-CsT50nMDp7fAS_CaAv4d02xOK1unzuuQK4fAz7iG9XtTnbOaX_4KtVRt9mtufcJnTJ_AP685toTozJwlXGKxZK9NMnlZP8hePYzOzYoxxpVA7wxQH6orOQdcrP0WYWyK0qEWKuhkvzJ5rVe9lOMcZ3qGg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/SKZ863-WZXTGv1Lh44gUde-X2x_9yf6NF4TNmtbn5y